# openspec/config.yaml
context: |
  Implementation is not done until ai_technical/CodeReview/code-review.md has been executed on the change diff.

rules:
  tasks:
    - Do not add a task that says "run code review". Review happens in apply, not in the plan.

operations:
  apply:
    - After the tasks for this session are implemented, read ai_technical/CodeReview/code-review.md and execute it on the diff.
    - Review against proposal.md, specs, and design.md. Fix findings in code before marking those tasks done.
    - Record blocking findings in the change folder. Do not mark tasks complete while a blocker is open.
  archive:
    - Re-read ai_technical/CodeReview/code-review.md and run it on the full change diff.
    - If a blocking finding has no fix, stop. Do not archive.
